# Claude Code's own runtime state, not project source — launch.json points
# at a venv path on one particular machine, which is nobody else's business
# and wrong everywhere but here.
.claude/
#  Working notes for the AI assistant, if kept locally. They were in the
#  repository once and came out: version control and the issue log are
#  the record. A local copy stays local.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
BOW.md
#  No pattern here for password files, on purpose. A file holding a
#  password does not belong in this folder at all, hidden or not; the
#  pre-commit hook (.githooks/pre-commit) refuses to commit one by name
#  or by content, which makes it something to deal with rather than
#  something to live beside.
app/data/template-packages/
preview-emails.html
